### 继承关系图
```
ACharacter (UE 引擎基类)
 └── AAuraCharacterBase (项目基类)
 ├── AAuraCharacter (玩家角色)
 └── AAuraEnemy (敌人角色)
```

### 接口实现
```
AAuraCharacterBase
 ├── IAbilitySystemInterface (GAS 接口)
 └── ICombatInterface (战斗接口)

AAuraCharacter
 └── IPlayerInterface (玩家接口)

AAuraEnemy
 └── IEnemyInterface (敌人接口)
```

