## 数据绑定机制

### 委托定义
```cpp
// 属性变化委托
DECLARE_DYNAMIC_MULTICAST_DELEGATE_OneParam(FOnAttributeChangedSignature, float, NewValue);

// 玩家状态变化委托
DECLARE_DYNAMIC_MULTICAST_DELEGATE_OneParam(FOnPlayerStatChangedSignature, int32, NewValue);

// 属性信息委托
DECLARE_DYNAMIC_MULTICAST_DELEGATE_OneParam(FAttributeInfoSignature, const FAuraAttributeInfo&, Info);

// 技能信息委托
DECLARE_DYNAMIC_MULTICAST_DELEGATE_OneParam(FAbilityInfoSignature, const FAuraAbilityInfo&, Info);

// 消息委托
DECLARE_DYNAMIC_MULTICAST_DELEGATE_OneParam(FMessageWidgetRowSignature, FUIWidgetRow, Row);
```

### 绑定流程
```
1. HUD 创建 WidgetController
 ↓
2. WidgetController::SetWidgetControllerParams
 ↓
3. WidgetController::BindCallbacksToDependencies
 ↓
4. 监听 AttributeSet 属性变化
 ↓
5. 监听 PlayerState 状态变化
 ↓
6. 监听 ASC 事件
 ↓
7. WidgetController::BroadcastInitialValues
 ↓
8. Widget 接收初始值
```

---

## UI 更新流程

### 属性变化流程
```
1. GameplayEffect 应用
 ↓
2. AttributeSet::PostGameplayEffectExecute
 ↓
3. 属性值变化
 ↓
4. OnRep_Attribute (网络复制)
 ↓
5. AttributeValueChangeDelegate 触发
 ↓
6. WidgetController 接收回调
 ↓
7. WidgetController 广播委托
 ↓
8. Widget 更新 UI
```

### 完整示例
```cpp
// 1. AttributeSet 中属性变化
void UAuraAttributeSet::PostGameplayEffectExecute(const FGameplayEffectModCallbackData& Data)
{
 if (Data.EvaluatedData.Attribute == GetHealthAttribute())
 {
 SetHealth(FMath::Clamp(GetHealth(), 0.f, GetMaxHealth()));
 }
}

// 2. 网络复制
UFUNCTION()
void OnRep_Health(const FGameplayAttributeData& OldHealth) const
{
 GAMEPLAYATTRIBUTE_REPNOTIFY(UAuraAttributeSet, Health, OldHealth);
}

// 3. WidgetController 监听
AbilitySystemComponent->GetGameplayAttributeValueChangeDelegate(
 GetAuraAS()->GetHealthAttribute()).AddLambda(
 [this](const FOnAttributeChangeData& Data)
 {
 OnHealthChanged.Broadcast(Data.NewValue);
 }
 );

// 4. Widget Blueprint 绑定
Event OnHealthChanged
 ↓
Set Progress Bar Percent
```

